# Benchmark run output: thousands of per-record folders of PNGs/CSVs (2000+ across the ahus, ptbxl,
# cpsc and chapman runs), all regenerable from the export scripts + src.digitize + src.evaluate.
#
# Matches only *subdirectories* of results/ and the scored metrics CSVs. The handful of sample outputs
# committed at the top level of results/ (1.png..5.png, norm.png, their *_timeseries_canonical.csv and
# digitization_metadata.csv) sit directly in results/ rather than a subdirectory, so they stay tracked.
results/*/
results/*_metrics*.csv
